{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_7_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_7","textTraditional":"一、七年，春，王三月，叔姬歸於紀。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_7_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_7","textTraditional":"其不言逆何也？逆之道微，無足道焉爾。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_7_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_7","textTraditional":"二、滕侯卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_7_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_7","textTraditional":"滕侯無名，少曰世子，長曰君，狄道也。其不正者名也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_7_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_7","textTraditional":"三、夏，城中丘。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_7_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_7","textTraditional":"城為保民為之也。民眾城小則益城，益城無極。凡城之志，皆譏也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_7_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_7","textTraditional":"四、齊侯使其弟年來聘。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_7_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_7","textTraditional":"諸侯之尊，弟兄不得其屬通。其弟云者，以其來接于我，舉其貴者也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_7_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_7","textTraditional":"五、秋，公伐邾。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_7_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_7","textTraditional":"六、冬，天王使凡伯來聘，戎伐凡伯於楚丘以歸。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_7_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_7","textTraditional":"凡伯者何也？天子之大夫也。國而曰伐，此一人而曰伐何也？大天子之命也。戎者衞也。戎衞者，為其伐天子之使，貶而戎之也。楚丘，衞之邑也。以歸，猶愈于執也。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}